thought, I've at least settled on playing as a Brujah.<br /> <br /> If I'm not mistaken, you indicated that play times would be every Saturday from 2-4, and that I should get underway with character creation as soon as possible. Am I correct in this assumption, or have things already gotten underway?</div> </div> </div> </div>The game is still in the early recruitment phase, so there's no rush. I prefer to have a little bit of conversation with new players before getting into the game specifics, so message me through Skype for character creation info.<br /> <br /> The planned game day is Saturday, yes, but I was indicating my preferred hours to start a session, between 2 and 4pm Eastern Standard. Game sessions run for between 3 and 5 hours. Sorry if that was unclear. For character backstory description/summary, I normally ask for a short 2-3 paragraph writeup. Further details can be written down later, once there's some story development. 4 page Revised/V20 editable Mr. Gone character sheet pdfs are standard for the game.<br /> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/VtM/VampireRev4-Page_Editable.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...e_Editable.pdf</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/V20/V20_4-Page_Elder_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a><br /> <br /> I'll be around on Skype when you have a chance to converse further. Looking forward to gaming with you!<br /> <br /> - Az","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-a